    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Elysium!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op sci-fi survival game set in the ruins of a lost world. Explore the ruins filled with ancient machinery once powered by Elythian technology. Rebuild, fight back against corrupted machines and mutated lifeforms, and uncover the truth behind a fallen utopia.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/3d2671094b4015eeea06fba07048063a.webp?t=1754735537\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/7cde51278efa6a3821e6b353865bae49.poster.avif?t=1754735537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/7cde51278efa6a3821e6b353865bae49.webm?t=1754735537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/7cde51278efa6a3821e6b353865bae49.mp4?t=1754735537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/c933712007f2170a331ea58d7dec070f.webp?t=1754735537\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op sci-fi survival journey in the ruins of a fallen utopia once powered by Elythian technology. Scavenge, explore, and bring ancient systems back online ,from silent towers to transit lines, reshaping routes as you go. Every activation reveals new paths, fresh resources, and hints of the intelligence that still lurks in the ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/24555683bd6f9652914b0d0a0d76b444.webp?t=1754735537\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/46bd66ae841744b5819651b4088110bb.poster.avif?t=1754735537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/46bd66ae841744b5819651b4088110bb.webm?t=1754735537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/46bd66ae841744b5819651b4088110bb.mp4?t=1754735537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/c933712007f2170a331ea58d7dec070f.webp?t=1754735537\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two deadly threats stand in your way: mutated wildlife twisted by radiation, and corrupted Elythian machines still guarding the ruins. Learn their patterns, dodge precisely, and strike back with crafted gear and scavenged firepower. From roaming spider-bots to towering defense units, Elysium's guardians are fast, brutal, and unrelenting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/4e80e6dd3655a55836c6f6d6205f69c4.webp?t=1754735537\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/607b74d3757cd1391d5eba4ec7435783.poster.avif?t=1754735537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/607b74d3757cd1391d5eba4ec7435783.webm?t=1754735537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/607b74d3757cd1391d5eba4ec7435783.mp4?t=1754735537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/c933712007f2170a331ea58d7dec070f.webp?t=1754735537\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim a spot whether it is a cliffside, riverside, deep forest and build wooden walls, floors, and ramps to raise your first base. Gather wood, stone, and ore to craft better tools and weapons, stepping up from rough stone to sturdier gear and early firepower. Expand, reinforce, and turn a shelter into a launchpad for longer expeditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/8a17f9c3332cca177a3f28d68e5b3238.webp?t=1754735537\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/cf9ab29036d09a6b18da0990d8024779.poster.avif?t=1754735537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/cf9ab29036d09a6b18da0990d8024779.webm?t=1754735537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/cf9ab29036d09a6b18da0990d8024779.mp4?t=1754735537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/c933712007f2170a331ea58d7dec070f.webp?t=1754735537\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go it alone or team up online. Share materials, revive each other mid-fight, and tackle tougher ruins together. Coordinate roles and push deeper as a squad to restore more of the island and uncover what brought this utopia to its knees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WISHLIST ELYSIUM TO FOLLOW THE JOURNEY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is waking up. Be there when it does.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Elysium!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op sci-fi survival game set in the ruins of a lost world. Explore the ruins filled with ancient machinery once powered by Elythian technology. Rebuild, fight back against corrupted machines and mutated lifeforms, and uncover the truth behind a fallen utopia.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/3d2671094b4015eeea06fba07048063a.webp?t=1754735537\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/7cde51278efa6a3821e6b353865bae49.poster.avif?t=1754735537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/7cde51278efa6a3821e6b353865bae49.webm?t=1754735537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/7cde51278efa6a3821e6b353865bae49.mp4?t=1754735537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/c933712007f2170a331ea58d7dec070f.webp?t=1754735537\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op sci-fi survival journey in the ruins of a fallen utopia once powered by Elythian technology. Scavenge, explore, and bring ancient systems back online ,from silent towers to transit lines, reshaping routes as you go. Every activation reveals new paths, fresh resources, and hints of the intelligence that still lurks in the ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/24555683bd6f9652914b0d0a0d76b444.webp?t=1754735537\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/46bd66ae841744b5819651b4088110bb.poster.avif?t=1754735537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/46bd66ae841744b5819651b4088110bb.webm?t=1754735537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/46bd66ae841744b5819651b4088110bb.mp4?t=1754735537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/c933712007f2170a331ea58d7dec070f.webp?t=1754735537\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two deadly threats stand in your way: mutated wildlife twisted by radiation, and corrupted Elythian machines still guarding the ruins. Learn their patterns, dodge precisely, and strike back with crafted gear and scavenged firepower. From roaming spider-bots to towering defense units, Elysium's guardians are fast, brutal, and unrelenting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/4e80e6dd3655a55836c6f6d6205f69c4.webp?t=1754735537\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/607b74d3757cd1391d5eba4ec7435783.poster.avif?t=1754735537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/607b74d3757cd1391d5eba4ec7435783.webm?t=1754735537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/607b74d3757cd1391d5eba4ec7435783.mp4?t=1754735537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/c933712007f2170a331ea58d7dec070f.webp?t=1754735537\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim a spot whether it is a cliffside, riverside, deep forest and build wooden walls, floors, and ramps to raise your first base. Gather wood, stone, and ore to craft better tools and weapons, stepping up from rough stone to sturdier gear and early firepower. Expand, reinforce, and turn a shelter into a launchpad for longer expeditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/8a17f9c3332cca177a3f28d68e5b3238.webp?t=1754735537\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/cf9ab29036d09a6b18da0990d8024779.poster.avif?t=1754735537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/cf9ab29036d09a6b18da0990d8024779.webm?t=1754735537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/cf9ab29036d09a6b18da0990d8024779.mp4?t=1754735537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/c933712007f2170a331ea58d7dec070f.webp?t=1754735537\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go it alone or team up online. Share materials, revive each other mid-fight, and tackle tougher ruins together. Coordinate roles and push deeper as a squad to restore more of the island and uncover what brought this utopia to its knees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WISHLIST ELYSIUM TO FOLLOW THE JOURNEY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is waking up. Be there when it does.</p>",
